 "description": "With unrivalled outdoor living space, the Swift Trawler 54 breaks the mould in passagemaking. This perfect family home on the water offers boaters the opportunity to enjoy efficient long-range cruising in an elegant and cosy atmosphere amidst ultimate comfort.\nThis latest addition to the Swift Trawler range is a beautiful balance of accessible, spacious and home-inspired living where you enjoy the journey as much as the destination.",
