  {
   "kind": "slider-design-pleasure",
   "id": "anchor_main-points",
   "title": "Your new home on the water",
   "intro": "Offering extended outdoor space from bow to stern, the Swift Trawler 54 combines contemporary design, high-end finishes and innovations throughout to deliver an eye-catching cruiser that gives owners plentiful stowage and home comforts for weeks on board.",
   "items": [
    {
     "title": "Contemporary design",
     "text": "The design elements have been carefully curated to create an ambiance of elegance and sophistication. In every space, there is a focus on premium materials, exquisite craftsmanship, and attention to detail."
    },
    {
     "title": "Pioneering innovations",
     "text": "BENETEAU prides itself on embracing innovative solutions. The Dixon Yacht Design “Fusion” hull form ensures a more efficient navigation, with excellent all-round handling and comfort. The latest Sleipner Vector Gen 3 fins provide excellent stability with 360-degree control. The “easy load” lazarette and flybridge pushpit stowage are cutting-edge additions. The “Silent Boat” option allows for up to 10 hours of on anchor autonomy without the need to run the generator or disturb your neighbours in the bay, with solar panels topping up the lithium battery bank."
    },
    {
     "title": "Home-inspired space",
     "text": "Visibility, control, communication, convenience, and social dynamics, with the helmsman at heart, were central to the design process to create a safer, more enjoyable, and efficient boating experience. The design prioritises safe and easy circulation between the helm and galley side doors and the panoramic wheelhouse windows."
    }
   ],
